    "detailed_description": "Yolanda Rogers' career just hit rock bottom. Her star client, pop sensation Lamar Jelly, is behind bars for flinging his faeces at his drummer in a wild concert meltdown. Fired from her law firm and desperate for a change, Yolanda escapes to the sunny Dominican Republic for some much-needed R&amp;R. But what starts as a simple vacation takes an unexpected twist when she runs into not one, but two of her ex-girlfriends\u2014who are now happily together. Seeing their bliss sparks a bold idea in Yolanda: why not turn this love triangle into something even more exciting?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cCan We Be Three?\u201d is a playful and heartfelt Yuri Visual Novel and Dating Sim. Step into Yolanda\u2019s shoes as she navigates sun-soaked days in the Dominican Republic, rekindles old flames, and discovers just how far she\u2019ll go to find happiness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-\tBeautiful Anime Art<br />\r\n-\tA comedic yet also romantic storyline<br />\r\n-\tMultiple endings<br />\r\n-\tAfro-Caribbean fusion soundtrack",
